    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The committee is actually quite concerned that switching to a purely deterministic tool will lead to a drop in the quality of the reviews. They feel like we'll lose the ability to catch subtle logical flaws that aren't just simple citation errors. Don't you think there's a risk that moving to a more rigid system might hinder the deep technical analysis we currently provide?",
